  l3Assisted:
    instructionText: Fit the camshaft.
    instructionDetail: 'Fit the camshaft into its bearings above the crankshaft.

      1. 
      Take the camshaft from the tray.

      2.  Line its lobes up clear of the
      bearing housings.

      3.  Lay it into the bearings and check it turns freely.'
